# ==========================================
# Root .gitignore for UniCredit Portal (Fullstack BTL)
# Covers: Frontend (Next.js / Node) + Backend (C# / .NET) + IDEs & OS
# ==========================================

# -----------------
# Operating System Files
# -----------------
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
*.stackdump
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon?
._*

# -----------------
# IDEs and Editors
# -----------------
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vs/

# -----------------
# Node & Frontend (Next.js)
# -----------------
**/node_modules/
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.js
**/.yarn/cache
**/.yarn/unplugged
**/.yarn/build-state.yml
**/.yarn/install-state.gz
**/.pnp.*

# Next.js build output
**/.next/
**/out/
**/dist/
**/build/

# Environment files
.env
.env*.local
!.env.example

# Debug and Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
**/*.log

# Next.js telemetry and cache
.next/cache/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts.bak

# -----------------
# .NET / C# Backend
# -----------------
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Production.json

# Visual Studio build artifacts
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs

# Test Results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
**/packages/
!**/packages/build/

# Microsoft Azure / Publish Profiles
*.PublishSettings
*.pubxml
*.azurePubxml

# Temporary and Scratch Files
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
